                </td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-slate-300">
                  PIP inspections reclassify B2B to employment; back ZUS contributions + penalty interest + tax arrears.
                </td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-cyan-400">EOR or True B2B</td>
              </tr>
